 "description": "Written by `python -m understudy_engine.eval`. Section names and key shapes follow docs/API_CONTRACT.md (additions agreed 7 Nov). Every section is optional but typed; extra keys are allowed (additive). A section without numbers is a stub {status: pending|not_run|failed, reason, meta}. `limitations` is an array, not a section.",
